ra/xhigh review returns PASS_FINITE_COMPONENT_REVIEW with no required repair.\n\nOriginal CAS06 contract/conflict and all failed candidates remain unchanged. Lean proves first pressure/energy derivatives and a conditional second lapse derivative; whole-interval existence/uniqueness and all-variable second jets are outside this acceptance. Singular supplies two C01 certificates while Sage covers all components. Authors share gpt-6-sol/high. Scientific admission and CAS04 remain HOLD/BLOCKED.\n\nIncludes the previously reviewed runtime guidance regression (6 tests) and scalar evidence. Its historical scalar lifecycle transport HOLD remains preserved; the full successor has its own returned independent review. Retained raw logs and frozen review reports contain original whitespace; the full whitespace check reports these, and other source/docs pass. Dependency distributions are pinned locally rather than archived.\n\nNon-force feature publication only; no merge, installation, global policy edits or requested local LLM inference.\n","created_at":"2026-10-04T13:58:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T22:42:48Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1390edfc055a27da46c6872e01d3f8a43dd9df74","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/477/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/477/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/issues/477/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cosmosapjw-quantum/htt_base/statuses/1a3755365bb72f4197292e4aa70fa71855744b8b","head":{"label":"cosmosapjw-quantum:proof/cas06-scalar-codex-only-20261004","ref":"proof/cas06-scalar-codex-only-20261004","sha":"1a3755365bb72f4197292e4aa70fa71855744b8b